{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/06/17/7403233/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/06/17/7403233/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"15・16日、静岡エコパアリーナにて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『真夏の全国ツアー2016 ～深川麻衣卒業コンサート～』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"に、お越しくださった皆さん、\n有難うございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/06/17/7403233/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、何より、まいまい\n5年間お疲れさまでした ＊＊"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/06/17/7403233/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂が結成してから、\nこの日を迎えるまで、本当に\n色んなことがあったね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山笑ったね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山泣いたね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかったね！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/06/17/7403233/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑顔だけの毎日じゃなかったけど、\n寮生活とか、一緒に住んでた頃のこととか\n色々思い出すと、もう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"16歳で上京してきた自分にとっては、\nメンバーは家族以上の存在で、\n中でもまいまいは私にとって\nお姉ちゃんみたいな存在でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなのお姉ちゃんで居てくれて有難う。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒にディズニー行ったり、ごはん行ったり、\nほんと楽しかったです。\n私の出演した舞台にも毎回観にきてくれたね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どこまでも優しくて、どこまでも真っ直ぐで\nお世辞とかじゃなく、本気で心から\nこんなに素敵な人初めて出会ったよ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"知れば知るほど、どこまでも素敵な人。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/06/17/7403233/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またいつものように楽屋に入ったら、\nいつものようにみんなが居て\nそこにまいまいも居て、\nいつものように、\n「おはよう」って挨拶して"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつものように、\nくだらないことで沢山笑って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつものように、、、\nまだ側にいるような、そんな気がしてしまいます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう戻ってこないんだなあ、\n全部思い出に変わってしまうのね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思い出に負けないように、\nまいまいのこれからの人生が\nどうか幸せで溢れますように。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまい、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/06/17/7403233/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今まで有難う。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまいが１人で辛くなったら、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度は、わたしが守るからね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/06/17/7403233/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/06/17/7403233/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/06/17/7403233/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/06/17/7403233/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆヽ(｡･ω･｡)正義"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/06/17/7403233/0000.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}